      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2014 Société Française de Pharmacologie et de Thérapeutique.",
        "AbstractText": "A young girl aged 13-years-old treated with montelukast, fluticasone/salmeterol, desloratadine, fluticasone furoate and salbutamol has presented numerous spontaneous bruises after that treatment with montelukast was substituted by the generic form. Stopping montelukast allow a significant improvement in bruises."
